  "summary": "<p>Yesterday, President Donald J. Trump named Kirsten A. Davies to lead the White House Office of the National Cyber Director. A battle-tested cyber leader and the Pentagon’s Chief Information Officer, Davies will drive an America First cyber strategy that treats cybersecurity as national security and keeps the United States dominant and secure in cyberspace. Her [&#8230;]</p>\n<p>The post <a href=\"https://www.whitehouse.gov/releases/2026/11/president-trump-taps-pentagon-cyber-chief-kirsten-davies-as-national-cyber-director/\">President Trump Taps Pentagon Cyber Chief Kirsten Davies as National Cyber Director</a> appeared first on <a href=\"https://www.whitehouse.gov\">The White House</a>.</p>",
